            "zh-TW": "流出液請收集為化學（乙醇）廢液。其中含有胍鹽，切勿與漂白水混合，否則會產生有毒氣體。"
          },
          "duration": {
            "box": "b-spin"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "st-14",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              "Add ",
              {
                "box": "b-bz"
              },
              " of ",
              {
                "use": "u-bz"
              },
              " and spin for ",
              {
                "box": "b-spin"
              },
              ". Discard the flow-through."
            ],
            "zh-TW": [
              {
                "text": "加入 ",
                "draft": "machine"
              },
              {
                "box": "b-bz"
              },
              {
                "text": " 的 ",
                "draft": "machine"
              },
              {
                "use": "u-bz"
              },
              {
                "text": "，離心 ",
                "draft": "machine"
              },
              {
                "box": "b-spin"
              },
              {
                "text": "，倒掉流出液。",
                "draft": "machine"
              }
            ]
          },
          "duration": {
            "box": "b-spin"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "st-15",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              "Add ",
              {
                "box": "b-wz"
              },
              " of ",
              {
                "use": "u-wz"
              },
              " and spin for ",
              {
                "box": "b-spin"
              },
              ". Spin once more for ",
              {
                "box": "b-spin"
              },
              " to dry the membrane."
            ],
            "zh-TW": [
              {
                "text": "加入 ",
                "draft": "machine"
              },
              {
                "box": "b-wz"
              },
              {
                "text": " 的 ",
                "draft": "machine"
              },
              {
                "use": "u-wz"
              },
              {
                "text": "，離心 ",
