          "duration": {
            "n": "2",
            "unit": "min"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "st-16",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              "Move the column to a clean labelled tube without touching the flow-through, and let the ethanol evaporate for 2 minutes with the lid open."
            ],
            "zh-TW": [
              {
                "text": "將管柱移至乾淨、已標示的離心管，勿碰觸流出液，開蓋靜置 2 分鐘讓乙醇揮發。",
